{% comment %}
  Store-wide (not per-product) — a rollup of this store's own real, approved product reviews
  (see app/services/review.server.ts's getPublicStoreReviewSummary) plus currently-earned
  achievement medals, both sourced from app/routes/api.reviews.store.tsx. Not a separate
  "store review" entity — no such concept exists in the schema, and none is introduced here.
  Deliberately has no "Write a review" / "View all reviews" CTA: this app has no store-level
  review submission flow and no public, store-wide review listing page today (see
  PROJECT_STATE.md's "Public Review Pages" roadmap item) — every real review is tied to a
  specific product, and every real "write a review" action lives on that product's own page
  (see star_rating.liquid). Adding a CTA here with nowhere honest to send a shopper would be
  exactly the kind of fabricated affordance this app avoids; the summary + achievements below
  stand on their own as a trust signal. Colors/typography/spacing come from the same
  centralized Appearance System (Brand Studio) every other Imagyn widget on this storefront
  already uses.
{% endcomment %}
<div
  data-imagyn-store-reviews
  data-heading="{{ block.settings.heading }}"
></div>

<script src="{{ 'imagyn-appearance.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
<script src="{{ 'store-reviews.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Store Reviews",
  "target": "section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Store Reviews" }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
